-- הסכם קיבוצי מיוחד — החלת רפורמת אופק חדש באולפנים הממלכתיים להנחלת הלשון
-- העברית (6.8.2023): from 1.9.2023 every provision of the reform agreement
-- (the agreement of 25.12.2008 as amended, the agreements of 29.2.2012 and
-- 19.10.2022 among them) applies to the teaching employees of the State's
-- Hebrew ulpanim, who are treated as teachers of a primary school — save
-- that no benefit is paid twice, the 10.1.2008 stage-one supplement ends,
-- the ulpan's principal may ask a teacher for up to three frontal hours in
-- place of stay hours, paid as substitution, and the school-role allowance
-- of the 2022 agreement's §22 applies with the ulpan's principal as the
-- principal. An evening ulpan pays 25% more for each frontal hour from
-- 16:00. The principals' agreement of 4.3.2015 applies to ulpan principals,
-- their complexity level weighed by the ulpan's classes, the ulpanim
-- managed and an evening ulpan. A teacher off the reform has the 2022
-- shekel supplement; §§30–31 of the 2022 agreement apply and §29 does not;
-- the guides' agreement of 9.11.2016 reaches ulpan teachers. A one-time
-- grant of up to 15,000 for the full-time months of 1.9.2020–31.8.2023, a
-- further 600,000 a year to the welfare fund, exhaustion, industrial peace
-- to 31.12.2026, and the labour disputes cancelled.
--
-- The 2022 agreement and the principals' agreement of 2015 are encoded in
-- their modules, imported, and so are the base agreement's §§15, 29 and 31
-- this agreement names. The agreement of 10.1.2008, the guides' agreement,
-- the pension agreement of 24.8.2020 and the Women's Employment Law are not
-- encoded: what this agreement takes from them is an input, named.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `base-agreement-29`
IMPORT `2015-03-04_ofek-hadash_principals-pay-changes`
IMPORT `2022-10-19_ofek-hadash_wage-agreement`

§ `הסכם קיבוצי מיוחד — החלת רפורמת אופק חדש באולפנים — 6.8.2023`

-- akn:preamble The agreement's frame: a label row with no text of its own.
-- akn:preamble/p1 The registration stamp under the Collective Agreements Law (17.12.2023, no. 311/2023); no rule.

-- The day of signing.
@ref akn:preamble/p2
`the signing of the ulpan agreement` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 6 8 2023

-- The parties: the State, by the Treasury's wages commissioner and the
-- acting director-general of the Ministry of Education, and the teachers'
-- union, by its secretary-general.
@ref akn:preamble/p3 akn:preamble/p4 akn:preamble/p6 akn:preamble/p7
`the ulpan agreement's parties` MEANS LIST `the State`, `the teachers' union`

-- akn:preamble/p5 "On the one side"; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p8 "On the other side"; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p9 A recital: the reform agreements of 10.9.07 and 25.12.08; the instrument applied is named below.

-- The recitals define who is covered and what applies: the teaching
-- employees of the Ministry of Education in the State's Hebrew ulpanim, to
-- whom the reform is applied ("עובדי ההוראה באולפנים"); and the reform
-- agreement of 25.12.2008 as updated from time to time, the agreements of
-- 29.2.2012 and 19.10.2022 included ("הסכם רפורמת אופק"), subject to this
-- agreement — the 2022 agreement's module imported above.
@ref akn:preamble/p10 akn:preamble/p11
`the reform agreement applied to the ulpanim includes the agreement of` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 19 10 2022

-- akn:preamble/p12 A recital: the reform changes the ulpan teachers' pay structure and raises it, budgetary pensioners included; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p13 A recital: the determining salary for pension is computed by the pension agreement of 24.8.2020 ("the comprehensive pension agreement"); §12 below.

-- The recital's "ulpan employee with an Ofek grade on the eve of the
-- signing": one whose grade in the reform was set before the signing, for
-- employment in an institution other than an ulpan.
@ref akn:preamble/p14
DECLARE `ulpan teacher's path` IS ONE OF
    `an ulpan employee with an Ofek grade on the eve of the signing`
    `an ulpan teacher moving to the reform`
    `an ulpan teacher staying off the reform`

-- akn:preamble/p15 A recital: with the waves of immigration the ulpanim's needs may change; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p16 A recital: the parties anchor what they agreed in this agreement; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p17 The words of agreement that introduce the clauses; no rule.

§§ `א. כללי`

DECLARE `part of the ulpan agreement` IS ONE OF `the ulpan agreement's preamble`, `the ulpan agreement's clauses`

-- 1: the preamble is an inseparable part of it.
@ref akn:art_1
GIVEN p IS A `part of the ulpan agreement`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `binds as the ulpan agreement` p IF
    TRUE

-- 2: the headings are for convenience and do not bear on its reading.
@ref akn:art_2
GIVEN `the reading without the headings` IS A STRING, `the reading the headings suggest` IS A STRING
GIVETH A STRING
DECIDE `the reading the ulpan agreement takes` `the reading without the headings` `the reading the headings suggest` IS
    `the reading without the headings`

-- 3: the masculine or the feminine is for convenience; all of it applies to
-- women and men alike.
@ref akn:art_3
`every word of the ulpan agreement applies to women and men alike` MEANS TRUE

§§ `ב. תחולה`

@desc A teaching employee, as far as the ulpan agreement asks who it covers.
DECLARE `ulpan employee` HAS
    `a teaching employee of the Ministry in a State Hebrew ulpan` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the ulpan teacher's path`                                    IS A `ulpan teacher's path`
    `his share of a position in the ulpan`                        IS A NUMBER

-- 4: every ulpan teacher as the recitals define them, the one with an Ofek
-- grade on the eve of the signing included ("עובדי ההוראה"), for the part
-- of his position in the ulpan.
@ref akn:art_4
GIVEN e IS AN `ulpan employee`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the share of his position the ulpan agreement reaches` e IS
    IF e's `a teaching employee of the Ministry in a State Hebrew ulpan`
    THEN e's `his share of a position in the ulpan`
    ELSE 0

§§ `ג. תחילה, תוקף ותנאים`

-- 5: it begins on 1.9.23 ("the commencement").
@ref akn:art_5
`the commencement of the ulpan agreement` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2023

§§ `ד. החלת הסכם רפורמת אופק באולפנים`

-- 6: from the commencement every provision of the reform agreement applies
-- to them, subject to (א)–(ה). The 2022 agreement left ulpan teachers out of
-- its §2 (imported); this agreement brings them under the reform, and with
-- it the 2022 agreement's chapter B, through the definition above.
@ref akn:art_6
GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the reform agreement applies to an ulpan teacher on` d IF
    d `is on or after` `the commencement of the ulpan agreement`

#ASSERT NOT `covered by the agreement` `an ulpan teacher on Ofek Hadash terms`
#ASSERT `the reform agreement applies to an ulpan teacher on` `the commencement of the ulpan agreement`

-- (א): for every provision of the reform agreement, the salary conversion
-- and any other right or benefit included, ulpan teachers are teachers of a
-- primary school: their week is §15's (imported).
DECLARE `what the reform agreement treats an ulpan teacher as` IS ONE OF
    `a teacher in a primary school, for the ulpan agreement`

@ref akn:art_6__para_a
`what the reform agreement treats an ulpan teacher as, from the commencement` MEANS `a teacher in a primary school, for the ulpan agreement`

`an ulpan teacher's full week` MEANS `a primary teacher's full week`

-- (ב): no right, payment or benefit twice under this agreement, where it
-- was already given for the same period before the commencement; no
-- provision of the reform agreement applied again where it already was.
-- ¶2, for example: one with an Ofek grade on the eve of the signing is not
-- converted as an "existing teacher" under §§43–48 or 54–61, and one
-- already entitled to age hours on the eve of the commencement has none by
-- this agreement (and keeps what he had).
@ref akn:art_6__para_b
GIVEN `already given for the same period before the commencement` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the ulpan agreement gives the benefit` `already given for the same period before the commencement` IF
    NOT `already given for the same period before the commencement`

@ref akn:art_6__para_b/p2
GIVEN p IS AN `ulpan teacher's path`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an ulpan teacher is converted as an existing teacher under §§43–48 or 54–61` p IF
    p EQUALS `an ulpan teacher moving to the reform`

@ref akn:art_6__para_b/p2
GIVEN `entitled to age hours on the eve of the commencement` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the ulpan agreement gives him age hours` `entitled to age hours on the eve of the commencement` IF
    NOT `entitled to age hours on the eve of the commencement`

#ASSERT NOT `an ulpan teacher is converted as an existing teacher under §§43–48 or 54–61` `an ulpan employee with an Ofek grade on the eve of the signing`

-- (ג): §3 of the special agreement of 10.1.2008 (entry to stage one of the
-- reform) does not apply to them from the reform's application; from the
-- commencement at the latest no ulpan teacher has its supplement, which
-- was paid against individual hours. The agreement of 10.1.2008 is not
-- encoded.
@ref akn:art_6__para_c
GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the stage-one supplement of 10.1.2008 is paid to an ulpan teacher on` d IF
    NOT d `is on or after` `the commencement of the ulpan agreement`

DECLARE `ulpan action` IS ONE OF
    `ask a teacher to teach up to 3 further frontal hours in place of as many stay hours`
    `agree to teach the further frontal hours`
    `transfer the further yearly budget to the welfare fund`
    `raise a further claim on applying the reform to the ulpan teachers`
    `negotiate further economic demands for applying the reform to the ulpanim`
    `strike or otherwise disrupt work against the State, to 31.12.2026`
    `strike or otherwise disrupt work over a matter the ulpan agreement settles`

-- (ד): notwithstanding §15 of the reform agreement, the ulpan's principal
-- may ask a teacher employed as a teacher in the ulpan to teach up to 3
-- frontal hours of his Ofek week ("a further frontal hour") in place of as
-- many of its stay hours; if he agrees, each is paid as a substitution hour
-- done in place of a stay hour, §29(ד) of the reform agreement (imported).
-- "עד 3" caps the hours asked and takes 3 in (recorded under
-- thresholds.until's exceptions).
@ref akn:art_6__para_d
`asking for further frontal hours in an ulpan` MEANS
    PARTY `the principal`
    MAY   `ask a teacher to teach up to 3 further frontal hours in place of as many stay hours`
    HENCE (PARTY `the teaching employee`
           MAY   `agree to teach the further frontal hours`)

@ref akn:art_6__para_d
GIVEN `further frontal hours` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `further frontal hours an ulpan principal may ask for` `further frontal hours` IF
    `further frontal hours` AT MOST 3

@ref akn:art_6__para_d
GIVEN `further frontal hours` IS A NUMBER, p IS A `pay for the hour value`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the pay for further frontal hours in an ulpan` `further frontal hours` p IS
    `further frontal hours` TIMES `pay for a substitution hour` `in place of a stay hour that day, the stay hour not done` p

-- An ulpan teacher's week with 3 further frontal hours: 29, 5 and 2 of §15's
-- 26, 5 and 5; each hour paid at 125% of the hour value, and the stay
-- hour's own 100% not paid (§29(ד)).
#ASSERT `further frontal hours an ulpan principal may ask for` 3
#ASSERT NOT `further frontal hours an ulpan principal may ask for` 4
#ASSERT `the pay for further frontal hours in an ulpan` 3 `a teacher for the hour value` EQUALS 3 TIMES 1.25 TIMES 55
#ASSERT `the stay hour's own pay kept, as a share of the hour` `in place of a stay hour that day, the stay hour not done` EQUALS 0

-- (ה): by (א), §22 of the 2022 agreement ("הסכם 2022": the school-role
-- allowance) applies to ulpan teachers, "the principal" being the ulpan's.
-- The agreement's rule asks the kind of institution; an ulpan reads as a
-- primary (elementary) school.
@ref akn:art_6__para_e
GIVEN `school year beginning` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the ulpan principal may set school roles` `school year beginning` IF
    `the principal may set school roles` `an elementary school` `school year beginning`

@ref akn:art_6__para_e
GIVEN units IS A NUMBER, `position share` IS A NUMBER, `the ulpan's principal` IS A BOOLEAN, `fills the role` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the ulpan school-role allowance` units `position share` `the ulpan's principal` `fills the role` IS
    `the school-role allowance` units `position share` `the ulpan's principal` `fills the role`

#ASSERT `the ulpan principal may set school roles` 2025
#ASSERT NOT `the principal may set school roles` `another institution` 2025
#ASSERT `the ulpan school-role allowance` 3 0.5 FALSE TRUE EQUALS 600

§§ `7 אולפן ערב`

-- ¶1: an "evening ulpan" is an ulpan where, in the school year, classes
-- are taught (frontal teaching) from 16:00 on.
@ref akn:art_7/p1
GIVEN `the latest hour a class starts in the school year` IS A NUMBER @desc in minutes from midnight
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an evening ulpan` `the latest hour a class starts in the school year` IF
    `the latest hour a class starts in the school year` AT LEAST 16 TIMES 60

-- (א): for each frontal teaching hour in a class done in an evening ulpan
-- from 16:00 on, a supplement of 25% of the value of a substitution hour
-- done in place of a stay hour (§31(א)(2) of the reform agreement), as it
-- is from time to time ("the pay for an evening ulpan teaching hour").
-- F-ofek-hadash-ulpan-2023-a: "the value of a substitution hour" may be
-- §31's hour value, on the base of §31(א)(2), or the pay of such an hour,
-- 125% of it by §29(ד). The clause names §31(א)(2), the base of the hour
-- value: the hour value is read (convention reading.referral).
@ref akn:art_7__para_a
GIVEN `starts at` IS A NUMBER @desc the hour's start, in minutes from midnight
      `in an evening ulpan` IS A BOOLEAN
      p IS A `pay for the hour value`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the pay for an evening ulpan teaching hour` `starts at` `in an evening ulpan` p IS
    IF `in an evening ulpan` AND `starts at` AT LEAST 16 TIMES 60
    THEN 25% TIMES `the hour value for` `a substitution hour in place of a stay hour, paid instead of it (§29(ד))` p
    ELSE 0

-- The other reading: 25% of the substitution hour's pay.
GIVEN p IS A `pay for the hour value`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the evening supplement on the substitution hour's pay` p IS
    25% TIMES `pay for a substitution hour` `in place of a stay hour that day, the stay hour not done` p

`the evening supplement is 13.75 by the reading and 17.19 on the substitution pay` MEANS
        `the pay for an evening ulpan teaching hour` (16 TIMES 60) TRUE `a teacher for the hour value` EQUALS 13.75
    AND `the evening supplement on the substitution hour's pay` `a teacher for the hour value` EQUALS 17.1875
#ASSERT `the evening supplement is 13.75 by the reading and 17.19 on the substitution pay`
#ASSERT `the pay for an evening ulpan teaching hour` (15 TIMES 60 PLUS 59) TRUE `a teacher for the hour value` EQUALS 0

-- (ב): on that pay, contributions by the rules for the pay of a
-- substitution hour done in place of a stay hour and not included in the
-- regular position's pay — §29(ו)'s 5% and 5% (imported).
@ref akn:art_7__para_b
`the employer's contribution on evening ulpan pay` MEANS `the employer's contribution on substitution pay`
`the employee's contribution on evening ulpan pay` MEANS `the employee's contribution on substitution pay`

-- (ג): it is counted in no salary supplement, in shekels or a percentage.
@ref akn:art_7__para_c
GIVEN `a supplement computed on the salary` IS A STRING
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the evening ulpan pay counts in` `a supplement computed on the salary` IF
    FALSE

§§ `8 הסכם המנהלים — סעיף 15א`

-- 8: the principals' agreement of 4.3.2015 (imported) applies to ulpan
-- principals, and after its §15 comes §15א: an ulpan principal's
-- complexity level, by which his pay is computed, weighs (1) the ulpan
-- classes he manages, (2) the ulpanim he manages and (3) managing an
-- evening ulpan. ¶2: the level is set by this and by no other provision of
-- the principals' agreement on an institution's level; the rest of it
-- stands. As with the 2015 agreement's own parameters, how they are
-- weighed is not printed: the level is an input, one of 2015's levels.
DECLARE `ulpan complexity parameter` IS ONE OF
    `the ulpan classes he manages`
    `the ulpanim he manages`
    `managing an evening ulpan`

@ref akn:art_8 akn:art_8/p2 akn:art_8__para_1 akn:art_8__para_2 akn:art_8__para_3
`the parameters §15א weighs for an ulpan principal` MEANS
    LIST `the ulpan classes he manages`, `the ulpanim he manages`, `managing an evening ulpan`

@ref akn:art_8__para_3/p2
GIVEN `the level the Ministry set by §15א` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `an ulpan principal's complexity level` `the level the Ministry set by §15א` IS
    IF `a complexity level of 2015` `the level the Ministry set by §15א`
    THEN JUST `the level the Ministry set by §15א`
    ELSE NOTHING

#ASSERT count `the parameters §15א weighs for an ulpan principal` EQUALS 3
#ASSERT `an ulpan principal's complexity level` 9 EQUALS NOTHING

§§ `ה. תנאי העסקה טרום רפורמה`

-- 9: from the commencement, a teacher not employed on the reform's terms,
-- by the rules for that, has the 2022 shekel supplement of §27 of the 2022
-- agreement (imported) — from 1.9.2023, where §27 pays from 1.9.2022.
@ref akn:art_9
GIVEN `position share` IS A NUMBER, d IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 2022 shekel supplement of an ulpan teacher off the reform` `position share` d IS
    IF d `is on or after` `the commencement of the ulpan agreement`
    THEN `the 2022 shekel supplement` `position share` d
    ELSE 0

#ASSERT `the 2022 shekel supplement of an ulpan teacher off the reform` 1 (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2023) EQUALS 500
#ASSERT `the 2022 shekel supplement of an ulpan teacher off the reform` 1 (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2022) EQUALS 0

§§ `ו. כלל עובדי ההוראה`

-- 10: §§30 and 31 of the 2022 agreement (special contracts; the managers'
-- global salary) apply to the ulpan teachers (imported).
@ref akn:art_10
GIVEN `employed on a special contract under the letter of 19.10.2022` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the collective agreements apply to an ulpan teacher` `employed on a special contract under the letter of 19.10.2022` IF
    `the collective agreements apply to the employee` `employed on a special contract under the letter of 19.10.2022`

#ASSERT NOT `the collective agreements apply to an ulpan teacher` TRUE
#ASSERT `the managers' salary pays for all their management work, whenever it is done`

-- 11: §29 of the 2022 agreement (two vacation days) does not apply to
-- ulpan teachers.
@ref akn:art_11
`§29 of the 2022 agreement applies to an ulpan teacher` MEANS FALSE

§§ `ז. הסכם הפנסיה הכולל`

-- 12: for the comprehensive pension agreement of 24.8.2020 (outside the
-- corpus), this agreement is "another collective agreement" in its
-- definition of "the terms of the Ofek Hadash reform" (its §4(א)).
@ref akn:art_12
`the ulpan agreement is another collective agreement for the pension agreement of 24.8.2020` MEANS TRUE

§§ `ח. הסכם המדריכים`

-- 13.1: for the definition of "a regulated guide" in §11 of the guides'
-- agreement of 9.11.2016 (outside the corpus), a teaching employee who
-- teaches (not guides) part of his position in an ulpan is employed in "an
-- institution of education in the State's service", from the commencement.
@ref akn:part_8__para_13-1
GIVEN `teaches part of his position in an ulpan` IS A BOOLEAN, d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `employed in an institution of education in the State's service, for the guides' agreement` `teaches part of his position in an ulpan` d IF
    `teaches part of his position in an ulpan` AND d `is on or after` `the commencement of the ulpan agreement`

-- 13.2: a guide guiding in an ulpan in the school year תשפ"ד (from
-- 1.9.2023), whose teaching that year is in the ulpan, who but for this
-- would be employed under §12(ג) of the guides' agreement, is paid for his
-- guiding part from the commencement as "a regulated guide" by 13.1, so
-- long as his guiding employment is not broken.
@ref akn:part_8__para_13-2 akn:part_8__para_13-2/p2
GIVEN `guides in an ulpan in תשפ"ד` IS A BOOLEAN, `his teaching that year is in the ulpan` IS A BOOLEAN, `would be under §12(ג) of the guides' agreement` IS A BOOLEAN, `his guiding employment was broken` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `paid as a regulated guide by the ulpan agreement` `guides in an ulpan in תשפ"ד` `his teaching that year is in the ulpan` `would be under §12(ג) of the guides' agreement` `his guiding employment was broken` IF
        `guides in an ulpan in תשפ"ד`
    AND `his teaching that year is in the ulpan`
    AND `would be under §12(ג) of the guides' agreement`
    AND NOT `his guiding employment was broken`

§§ `ט. מענק חד פעמי`

`the ulpan grant period starts` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2020
`the ulpan grant period ends` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 31 8 2023
`the ulpan one-time grant` MEANS 15000
`the ulpan grant period in months` MEANS 36

DECLARE `absence in the ulpan grant period` IS ONE OF
    `teaching in the ulpan`
    `on unpaid leave, or leave treated as unpaid, in the ulpan grant period`
    `on unpaid leave after maternity and parenthood, in the ulpan grant period`
    `in reserve duty, in the ulpan grant period`
    `in maternity and parenthood, in the ulpan grant period`
    `on unpaid sick leave, in the ulpan grant period`

@desc A stretch of the ulpan grant period at one share of a position.
DECLARE `stretch of the ulpan grant period` HAS
    `months of the ulpan stretch`          IS A NUMBER
    `share of a position in the ulpan stretch` IS A NUMBER @desc for an absence of (ו), the share on its eve
    `what the teacher was doing in the ulpan stretch` IS A `absence in the ulpan grant period`

GIVEN n IS A NUMBER, share IS A NUMBER, a IS AN `absence in the ulpan grant period`
GIVETH A `stretch of the ulpan grant period`
DECIDE `an ulpan grant stretch of` n share a IS
    `stretch of the ulpan grant period` WITH
        `months of the ulpan stretch`          IS n
        `share of a position in the ulpan stretch` IS share
        `what the teacher was doing in the ulpan stretch` IS a

-- (ד)–(ה): unpaid leave, or leave treated as unpaid — after maternity and
-- parenthood too — does not count; reserve duty, maternity and parenthood
-- (26 weeks, by §6 of the Women's Employment Law) and unpaid sick leave do.
-- (ו): a month of these absences counts at the share on their eve; ¶2: and
-- above 100% as 100%. (ז): (ה)–(ו) apply to both sexes.
@ref akn:art_14__para_d akn:art_14__para_e akn:art_14__para_f akn:art_14__para_f/p2 akn:art_14__para_g
GIVEN a IS AN `absence in the ulpan grant period`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an ulpan stretch counts toward the grant` a IF
        NOT a EQUALS `on unpaid leave, or leave treated as unpaid, in the ulpan grant period`
    AND NOT a EQUALS `on unpaid leave after maternity and parenthood, in the ulpan grant period`

-- (ב)–(ג): a month's share of a position above 100% counts as 100%.
@ref akn:art_14__para_b akn:art_14__para_c
GIVEN s IS A `stretch of the ulpan grant period`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the full-position months of an ulpan grant stretch` s IS
    IF `an ulpan stretch counts toward the grant` (s's `what the teacher was doing in the ulpan stretch`)
    THEN s's `months of the ulpan stretch` TIMES min (s's `share of a position in the ulpan stretch`) 1
    ELSE 0

-- 14: at the commencement, an ulpan teacher employed in the ulpan on the
-- reform's terms from the commencement ("an ulpan teacher for the grant")
-- who was in a full position in an ulpan in the State's service throughout
-- 1.9.2020–31.8.2023 has a one-time grant of 15,000. (א)–(ג): one in a full
-- position for part of it, in a part position for all of it, or both, has
-- the share of it his full-position months are of the 36.
@ref akn:art_14 akn:art_14__para_a
GIVEN `on the reform's terms in the ulpan from the commencement` IS A BOOLEAN
      stretches IS A LIST OF `stretch of the ulpan grant period`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the ulpan one-time grant for` `on the reform's terms in the ulpan from the commencement` stretches IS
    IF `on the reform's terms in the ulpan from the commencement`
    THEN `the ulpan one-time grant`
         TIMES min 1 (sum (map `the full-position months of an ulpan grant stretch` stretches) DIVIDED BY `the ulpan grant period in months`)
    ELSE 0

#ASSERT `the ulpan one-time grant for` TRUE (LIST `an ulpan grant stretch of` 36 1 `teaching in the ulpan`) EQUALS 15000
#ASSERT `the ulpan one-time grant for` FALSE (LIST `an ulpan grant stretch of` 36 1 `teaching in the ulpan`) EQUALS 0

-- (א), the example: full time from 1.12.2020 to 31.8.2023 — the 9 months of
-- December 2020 to August 2021 and two years of 12 — 33; 33 × 15,000 / 36
-- = 13,750.
@ref akn:art_14__para_a/p2 akn:art_14__para_a/p3 akn:art_14__para_a/p4
#ASSERT `the ulpan one-time grant for` TRUE (LIST `an ulpan grant stretch of` (9 PLUS 2 TIMES 12) 1 `teaching in the ulpan`) EQUALS 13750

-- (ג), the example: 1.2.2021–31.8.2021 at 70% (7 months), 1.9.2021–
-- 31.8.2022 at 110%, counted as 100% (12), 1.9.2022–31.8.2023 at 100%
-- (12): (7 × 0.7 + 12 + 12) × 15,000 / 36 = 12,041.67, which the example
-- prints to the shekel, 12,042 (convention rounding.printed-figure).
@ref akn:art_14__para_c/p2 akn:art_14__para_c/p3 akn:art_14__para_c/p4 akn:art_14__para_c/p5 akn:art_14__para_c/p6 akn:art_14__para_c/p7 akn:art_14__para_c/p8 akn:art_14__para_c/p9 akn:art_14__para_c/p10 akn:art_14__para_c/p11
`the ulpan example of (ג)` MEANS
    LIST `an ulpan grant stretch of` 7 0.7 `teaching in the ulpan`,
         `an ulpan grant stretch of` 12 1.1 `teaching in the ulpan`,
         `an ulpan grant stretch of` 12 1 `teaching in the ulpan`

#ASSERT `to the nearest whole` (`the ulpan one-time grant for` TRUE `the ulpan example of (ג)`) EQUALS 12042
#ASSERT `the ulpan one-time grant for` TRUE (LIST `an ulpan grant stretch of` 12 1 `on unpaid leave, or leave treated as unpaid, in the ulpan grant period`) EQUALS 0

DECLARE `ulpan grant purpose` IS ONE OF
    `salary for every purpose, ulpan grant`
    `the hour value, and the pay for unique hours such as school activity hours, ulpan grant`
    `the salary reduction for an hour of absence, ulpan grant`
    `the payment under §33(ד), ulpan grant`
    `severance pay, ulpan grant`
    `provident-fund contributions, ulpan grant`
    `topping up to the minimum wage, ulpan grant`
    `the salary base of the combined-salary tables, ulpan grant`

-- (ח)–(י): the grant is not salary for any purpose; it counts for none of
-- these, no contributions are made on it, it is not in topping up to the
-- minimum wage, and it does not change the salary base of the tables.
@ref akn:art_14__para_h akn:art_14__para_i akn:art_14__para_j
GIVEN p IS AN `ulpan grant purpose`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the ulpan grant counts for` p IF
    FALSE

DECLARE `ulpan grant absence at payment` IS ONE OF
    `at work at the ulpan grant's payment`
    `on unpaid leave at the ulpan grant's payment`
    `on unpaid sick leave at the ulpan grant's payment`
    `in maternity and parenthood at the ulpan grant's payment`
    `absent for a work injury not charged to sick leave, at the ulpan grant's payment`

-- (יא): one entitled to the grant who, when it is paid, is away for one of
-- (1)–(4), is paid it in the first salary paid on his return, or at the
-- latest the next. F-ofek-hadash-ulpan-2023-b: (יא) names the payment "as
-- in section 9 below"; §9 is the pre-reform shekel supplement, and the day
-- of payment is §16's. §16 is read (convention reading.misprint).
@ref akn:art_14__para_ja akn:art_14__para_ja__subpara_1 akn:art_14__para_ja__subpara_2 akn:art_14__para_ja__subpara_3 akn:art_14__para_ja__subpara_4
GIVEN a IS AN `ulpan grant absence at payment`, `the latest salary month of §16` IS A NUMBER, `the first salary month on his return` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the last salary month the ulpan grant may be paid in` a `the latest salary month of §16` `the first salary month on his return` IS
    IF a EQUALS `at work at the ulpan grant's payment`
    THEN `the latest salary month of §16`
    ELSE `the first salary month on his return` PLUS 1

`(יא) cites §9, the shekel supplement, for the grant's payment, which §16 sets` MEANS
    `the 2022 shekel supplement of an ulpan teacher off the reform` 1 `the commencement of the ulpan agreement` EQUALS 500
    AND `the first salary month that pays the ulpan agreement` EQUALS `month` 2023 12
#ASSERT `(יא) cites §9, the shekel supplement, for the grant's payment, which §16 sets`

§§ `י. קרן רווחה`

-- 15: from 1.9.2023, a further yearly budget of 600,000 to the welfare fund
-- the parity follow-up committee set up on 15.4.2002, for the ulpan
-- teachers' welfare; the first by 31.12.2023 at the latest (days from the
-- signing).
@ref akn:art_15
`the further yearly budget of the welfare fund for the ulpan teachers` MEANS 600000

`days from the ulpan agreement's signing to 31.12.2023` MEANS
    DATE_SERIAL (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 12 2023) MINUS DATE_SERIAL `the signing of the ulpan agreement`

@ref akn:art_15
`the first further budget to the welfare fund` MEANS
    PARTY `the State`
    MUST  `transfer the further yearly budget to the welfare fund`
    WITHIN `days from the ulpan agreement's signing to 31.12.2023`
    LEST  BREACH BY `the State` BECAUSE "§15: the first further budget of 600,000 is transferred by 31.12.2023"

#ASSERT `days from the ulpan agreement's signing to 31.12.2023` EQUALS 147

§§ `יא. מועדי תשלום`

-- 16: what the agreement gives is paid from the salary of December 2023
-- (paid in January 2024), at the latest in the salary of January 2024
-- (paid in February), with the differences from 1.9.23. ¶2: the Ministry
-- may pay earlier, once it is ready. Salary months as the 2022 agreement
-- counts them (`month`, imported).
@ref akn:art_16 akn:art_16/p2
`the first salary month that pays the ulpan agreement` MEANS `month` 2023 12
`the latest salary month that pays the ulpan agreement` MEANS `month` 2024 1

GIVEN `the salary month paid in` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the ulpan agreement's payment is on time` `the salary month paid in` IF
    `the salary month paid in` AT MOST `the latest salary month that pays the ulpan agreement`

#ASSERT `the ulpan agreement's payment is on time` (`month` 2023 11)
#ASSERT NOT `the ulpan agreement's payment is on time` (`month` 2024 2)

§§ `יב. מיצוי תביעות`

-- 17–19: it fully exhausts the union's claims on applying the reform to
-- the ulpan teachers, fully on the change of their work and its price; no
-- further economic demands are negotiated. 21: the exhaustion provisions
-- that bind the parties stand.
@ref akn:art_17 akn:art_18 akn:art_19 akn:art_21
`no further claims on the ulpan teachers` MEANS
    (PARTY `the teachers' union`
     SHANT `raise a further claim on applying the reform to the ulpan teachers`)
    RAND
    (PARTY `the teachers' union`
     SHANT `negotiate further economic demands for applying the reform to the ulpanim`)

-- 20: because of 6(א), exhaustion provisions future agreements set on
-- updating the reform agreement for primary-school teachers in the State's
-- service apply to ulpan teachers too, unless the parties agree otherwise.
@ref akn:art_20
GIVEN `the future exhaustion reaches primary-school teachers` IS A BOOLEAN, `the parties agreed otherwise` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a future exhaustion reaches the ulpan teachers` `the future exhaustion reaches primary-school teachers` `the parties agreed otherwise` IF
    `the future exhaustion reaches primary-school teachers` AND NOT `the parties agreed otherwise`

§§ `יג. שקט תעשייתי`

-- 22: the union takes no strike, whole or partial, or other organised harm
-- to the work against the State, for the period to 31.12.2026; 23: nor over
-- the matters this agreement settles; 24: the industrial-peace provisions
-- that bind the parties stand.
@ref akn:art_22 akn:art_23 akn:art_24
`industrial peace under the ulpan agreement` MEANS
    (PARTY `the teachers' union`
     SHANT `strike or otherwise disrupt work against the State, to 31.12.2026`)
    RAND
    (PARTY `the teachers' union`
     SHANT `strike or otherwise disrupt work over a matter the ulpan agreement settles`)

`the ulpan agreement's industrial peace runs to` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 31 12 2026

§§ `יד. ביטול סכסוכי עבודה`

-- 25: every labour dispute about the ulpan teachers declared or announced
-- by the signing, that of 26.3.2023 included, is cancelled.
@ref akn:art_25
GIVEN `declared on` IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a labour dispute about the ulpan teachers stands` `declared on` IF
    NOT (`declared on` `is on or before` `the signing of the ulpan agreement`)

#ASSERT NOT `a labour dispute about the ulpan teachers stands` (DATE_FROM_DMY 26 3 2023)

